      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>So... Super Sentai Idealist and Completionist Guise.&nbsp; Both put cards under their character card, but with very different assumptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What happens if Completionist Guise has character cards under himself and uses I Can Do That Too to Form the Head?&nbsp; He should be able to destroy a character card.&nbsp; If he does, where does it go?&nbsp; Even more humorously, what if the villain is Challenge mode Chokepoint?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fortunately, it looks like if Super Sentai Idealist uses Called to Judgement or Character Witnesses to try to form her own&nbsp;Impressive Collection, the collected cards go under Guise and not Idealist.&nbsp; However, it does raise the question of where those character cards go when Representative of Earth is destroyed (and whether this triggers destruction effects).</p>",
